### ========================================
### HELPER REQUESTS TO GET IDs FOR TESTING
### ========================================

### Get all students (to find studentId)
GET http://localhost:8800/admin/students
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### Get all venues (to find venueId)
GET http://localhost:8800/venues
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get all time slots (optional, for timeSlotIds)
GET http://localhost:8800/timeslots
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ========================================
### TEST REQUEST CREATION WITH FORM DATA
### ========================================

### Step 1: Login as a student to get token
POST http://localhost:8800/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student_username",
  "password": "student_password"
}

### Step 2: Create request with form data (replace IDs and token)
POST http://localhost:8800/requests/requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "studentId": "YOUR_STUDENT_USER_ID",
  "venueId": "YOUR_VENUE_ID",
  "requiredDate": "2026-01-25T14:00:00.000Z",
  "form1Data": {
    "societyname": "IEEE",
    "eventtype": "Workshop",
    "excoposition": "President",
    "excomembername": "John Doe",
    "eventtitle": "Tech Workshop 2026",
    "participants": "50",
    "description": "A comprehensive workshop on emerging technologies and innovation"
  },
  "form2Data": {
    "equipmentNeeded": "Projector, Microphone",
    "setupTime": "30 minutes before"
  },
  "form3Data": {
    "cateringRequired": "yes",
    "dietaryRestrictions": "Vegetarian options needed"
  },
  "form4Data": {},
  "form5Data": {}
}

### Step 3: Get all requests to verify creation
GET http://localhost:8800/requests
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Step 4: Get specific student's requests
GET http://localhost:8800/students/YOUR_STUDENT_ID/requests
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
